+| `verification.k:40-57` | `rule-1b6d53d96f4b4a82eb6b7f9bafc5577f204500d0110e04dbb065f0e26a91bc18` | `DEFINITION` | Macro expansion of the named proof term `longestSolution` to the translated program closure. |
